  "description": {
    "text": "Basic Energy cards in the design that came in with Team Up, with a patterned background and a ©2019 line, in nine types. Like the 2017 Energies they carry no number and came in the booster packs of every English expansion from Team Up on; sheen holo copies came in booster packs too.",
